OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after three-car crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA woman in her 20s has died and another
OL,6,Fwoman has been seriously injured after
OL,7,Fthe vehicles they were driving were
OL,8,Finvolved in a three-car crash.
OL,10,FThe woman who died at the scene was
OL,11,Fdriving a white Lexus CT200 at about
OL,12,F07:15 BST on Bath Road, close to
OL,13,FFroxfield, near Hungerford.
OL,15,FThe injured woman, who is in her 40s,
OL,16,Fwas driving a silver Volkswagen Golf
OL,17,Fand taken to hospital. Two people in a
OL,18,FHonda Civic suffered minor injuries and
OL,19,Fdid not need hospital treatment.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
